cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite the paper below."
title: "Benchmarking Evo 2 on viral genomes — reproducibility repository"
abstract: >-
  Code, pre-registered corpus design, curated accession-level inputs and cached
  cross-validated metrics reproducing the capability benchmark of the Evo 2 genomic
  foundation model (20B base, with the 7B as scale comparator) on 19,429 RefSeq viral
  genomes, across representation probing, genomic-feature decoding and generative
  completion.
type: software
